<title>USA: Franklin, Voice Powered end merger pact.</title>
<headline>Franklin, Voice Powered end merger pact.</headline>
<dateline>TARZANA, Calif. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voice Powered Technology International Inc Wednesday said the proposed acquisition of VPTI by Franklin Electronic Publishers Inc has been terminated</p>
<p>The companies signed a letter of intent on February 25.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
</text>
